{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52204","headline":"颂六十二首 二十九 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 二十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"志诚抱冰雪，暮齿迫桑榆。\n太息波川迅，悲哉人代拘。\n岁聿皆采获，冬晚惧严枯。\n精诚求施戒，忍精定慧眸。\n结侣同共远，胜地心相符。\n商人不顾死，罗刹未能逾。\n求宝竭大海，神怖捧明珠。\n寄言求道者，立志菩提株。\n（见同书卷三六《济难部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52204.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52204","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}